# ==========================================
# UniHub - Root Environment Variables
# ==========================================
# This is a template file. Copy to .env and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit .env files to Git!

# Note: Backend and Frontend have their own .env files
# See backend/.env.example and frontend/.env.example for specific configurations

# ============ Quick Setup ============
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env
# 3. Copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env
# 4. Fill in all the values with your actual credentials
# 5. Never commit .env files to version control
